      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，交给你了。你的器量之大已是有目共睹，\n能帮助光明，“让她顺利追上”的\n人选也非你莫属。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1e1b32f478b75d582e4376f4a00540c460a89e0cde658edafd08636840ed9e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
